# Claude Code OAuth token -- get one by running `claude setup-token` on your host.
# Lets the agent use your Claude subscription instead of an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Or use an Anthropic API key instead -- uncomment and fill in:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Only CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY are allowed here, and
# main.mts refuses to run if this file sets anything else. No GitHub token:
# main.mts talks to GitHub on the host with your own gh login. Every key in
# this file is passed into the sandbox.
